Package: shinyterm
Title: Embed a Terminal Emulator in 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "rundel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' module that embeds an 'xterm.js' terminal in an app and
    connects it to a local process running inside a pseudo-terminal (via
    'processx'). Keystrokes are forwarded to the process and its output is
    streamed back to the browser, so interactive command line tools, including
    shells and agent CLIs such as 'claude' or 'codex', can run inside a
    'shiny' app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
